<div id="homecontent">

For over 58 years W. J. Graves has been supplying quality sand, gravel, stone, loam and other products to homeowners and the construction industry. We have the experience to provide you with quality products and proper advice to ensure you use the right products for whatever projects you have. We strive to maintain honesty and integrity in all aspects of our business. We have over 120 vehicles and equipment that we repair and maintain in our own repair facility in order to keep our expenses low and our availability high. This allows us to give excellent service at very competitive prices.

</div>
<div style="overflow: hidden; padding-top: 50px; width: 900px; margin: auto;">
<div style="float: left; padding-right: 30px; text-align: center;">
<a href="http://www.wjgraves.com/our-company/littletonlocation/">
<h3 class="cufon">Littleton Location</h3>
<img src="/wp-content/uploads/2011/03/location_photo.jpg" alt="" />
</a>
